    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure awaits in Wake World an open-ocean action RPG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.poster.avif?t=1753959219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.webm?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.mp4?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sail alone or with friends through a strange, decaying world. Battle bizarre creatures, brave shifting weather, and complete unique challenges across a chain of mysterious islands. Whether you're chasing the six lost artifacts or just soaking in the world, every step forward uncovers something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.poster.avif?t=1753959219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.webm?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.mp4?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Ship Is Your Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Steamship is not just a means of transportation, it's your home and base of operations. As you explore the world of Wake World, you will rely on your ship to traverse the ocean, discover new islands and face off against the dangers that lurk in the waters. As the seas become more hostiles you can fully customize and upgrade it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake World can be played as a coop multiplayer game, allowing players to join forces with others and embark on the adventure together. Play with friends or join a random group and work together to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Realistic hand to rock physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No game should launch into early access without it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.poster.avif?t=1753959219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.webm?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.mp4?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure awaits in Wake World an open-ocean action RPG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.poster.avif?t=1753959219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.webm?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.mp4?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sail alone or with friends through a strange, decaying world. Battle bizarre creatures, brave shifting weather, and complete unique challenges across a chain of mysterious islands. Whether you're chasing the six lost artifacts or just soaking in the world, every step forward uncovers something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.poster.avif?t=1753959219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.webm?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.mp4?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Ship Is Your Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Steamship is not just a means of transportation, it's your home and base of operations. As you explore the world of Wake World, you will rely on your ship to traverse the ocean, discover new islands and face off against the dangers that lurk in the waters. As the seas become more hostiles you can fully customize and upgrade it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake World can be played as a coop multiplayer game, allowing players to join forces with others and embark on the adventure together. Play with friends or join a random group and work together to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Realistic hand to rock physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No game should launch into early access without it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.poster.avif?t=1753959219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.webm?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.mp4?t=1753959219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Set sail with your crew in this open-ocean RPG. Battle sea monsters, discover unique islands, and survive an adventure where every fight matters. Build camps, master your skills, and explore deeper into beautiful but dangerous ocean that won't wait for anyone.",
